'''Rainbow Children's Medicare''', commonly known as '''Rainbow Hospitals''', is an Indian chain of [[Children's hospital|paediatric hospitals]] headquartered in [[Hyderabad]].<ref>''Rainbow Childrens Hospital And Perinatal Centre'', Practo, accessed at [https://www.practo.com/hyderabad/clinic/rainbow-childrens-hospital-and-perinatal-centre-banjara-hills] 20 Oct 2014</ref> Founded by Dr. Ramesh Kancharla in 1999,<ref>''HISTORY – TAKING A WALK DOWN THE MEMORY LANE'', Rainbow Hospitals, accessed at [http://www.rainbowhospitals.in/about-us/history.html] 20 Oct 2014</ref> the hospital's main focus is paediatric and maternal healthcare services.<ref>"Rainbow Hospitals gets Rs.100 crore funding from CDC, Abraaj Group", Livemint, accessed at [http://www.livemint.com/Companies/5FdCef7R555CSP0O4PZXEN/Rainbow-Hospitals-gets-100-crore-funding-from-CDC-Abraaj-G.html] 20 Oct 2014</ref> The flagship facility of Rainbow Children's Hospitals is located at [[Banjara Hills]], Hyderabad.<ref name="auto">"UAE’s Abraaj and UK’s CDC Invest $17.5m In India’s Rainbow Hospitals", Gulf Business, accessed at [http://gulfbusiness.com/2013/08/uaes-abraaj-and-uks-cdc-invest-17-5m-in-indias-rainbow-hospitals/] 20 Oct 2014</ref> The Rainbow Hospital Group currently operates out of 19 hospitals and 3 [[outpatient clinic]]s – eight in [[Hyderabad]], four in [[Bangalore]], two each in [[Delhi]], [[Chennai]], [[Vijayawada]], and [[Visakhapatnam]].<ref>"Rainbow Hospital is raising 250 crore", The Hindu [http://www.thehindu.com/business/Industry/rainbow-hospital-to-raise-rs250-crore-for-growth/article7747564.ece] 11 Oct 2015</ref><ref name="auto"/><ref>"Rainbow Hospital Expands to Chennai, Vizag", My Digital FC, accessed at [http://www.mydigitalfc.com/news/rainbows-hospitals-chain-expand-chennai-vizag-686] 25 June 2015</ref><ref>"Hospital chain Rainbow plans to raise Rs60-70 crore fresh equity", Live Mint, accessed at [http://www.livemint.com/Companies/9R6IZSXA4RkLh6hKbhKbfL/Hospital-chain-Rainbow-plans-to-raise-Rs6070-crore-fresh-eq.html] 25 June 2015</ref><ref>"PE-backed Rainbow Hospitals creating south-focused paediatric & maternal care chain", VC Circle, accessed at [http://www.vccircle.com/news/healthcare-services/2015/04/14/pe-backed-rainbow-hospitals-creating-south-focused-paediatric] 14 April 2015</ref>

