==Records==
*Rainbow Hospitals sets the "[[Guinness World Records|Guinness World Record]] —for the largest gathering of people born prematurely under one roof" on World Prematurity Day held on 17 November 2016<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/largest-gathering-of-people-born-prematurely|title=Guinness World Record|work=guinnessworldrecords.com|accessdate=20 July 2017}}</ref>
*Rainbow Children's Hospital attains a place in '[[Limca Book of Records|Limca book of records]] - for saving a baby born with 375gms of birth weight.{{Citation needed|date=December 2024}}

